# Iron rule 3 backups (~/.claude/CLAUDE.md): copy before modifying any
# spec / policy / strategy file. These are local safety copies -- git
# history already holds the real record, so tracking them is redundant
# and they otherwise bury `git status` under 40+ lines of noise.
# Added 2026-08-26 after the count reached 44.
*.bak_*
*.bak2_*
